{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932280/extras/a594de4dc67ce7247b9edddd79e40524.avif?t=1756993551\" width=600 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hectic <strong>rags-to-riches</strong> worker life-sim RPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Welcome to <strong>OIL TOWN</strong>. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In this demo version: play through a limited early section of the game!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932280/extras/b329246a198945c4c7a063227698d648.poster.avif?t=1756993551\" width=600 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932280/extras/b329246a198945c4c7a063227698d648.webm?t=1756993551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932280/extras/b329246a198945c4c7a063227698d648.mp4?t=1756993551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Set in the</strong> same world as <strong>FINAL PROFIT</strong>.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>With an original soundtrack by the creator (that\u2019s me).</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932280/extras/36475db06550b16e0fe0e9112d6e3733.avif?t=1756993551\" width=600 height=97 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rags to riches</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scoop oil, score loot, <i>get paid!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid hazards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield your mighty <i>mop!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow <i>stronger!</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932280/extras/ce2d3e248536c9ecce15fcd76142f4d8.poster.avif?t=1756993551\" width=600 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932280/extras/ce2d3e248536c9ecce15fcd76142f4d8.webm?t=1756993551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932280/extras/ce2d3e248536c9ecce15fcd76142f4d8.mp4?t=1756993551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Invest in yourself</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy better tools.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft <i>upgrades!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Own or rent buildings. (limited in demo)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A living town</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build persistent objects <i>in the world!</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time and schedules.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weather impacts work conditions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customise workmates.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Uncover secrets...</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932280/extras/df821bbc9f25a46db684e7f007ce3a23.avif?t=1756993551\" width=600 height=97 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Oil Barons</strong> have an iron grip on the oil wells of <i>Oil Town</i>, along with most everything else in the frontier settlement. Workers spend their hard earned coin buying small plots of land, hoping to get lucky and discover new wells. <i>This almost never happens.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But a mysterious dream</strong> led you to find one... Only problem is that you <i>don't own the land!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Joy will need</strong> to <i>work and save up</i> enough to buy it, while keeping the <i>secret</i> safe!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your shift starts at 7am. <i>Get scoopin'!</i></strong></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3932280?t=1756993551","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3932280?t=1756993551","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932280/91719d0ce2f64e18176a1e96e2bbbfce41448ce8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756993551","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932280/91719d0ce2f64e18176a1e96e2bbbfce41448ce8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756993551","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932280/extras/a594de4dc67ce7247b9edddd79e40524.avif?t=1756993551\" width=600 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hectic <strong>rags-to-riches</strong> worker life-sim RPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Welcome to <strong>OIL TOWN</strong>. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In this demo version: play through a limited